{"id":"n24055-1-8","stage":1,"title":"음식점 · 餐厅","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24055-1-8-1","ko":"네가 저번에 괜찮다던 음식점에 한번 가 볼까 해.","zh":"我打算去你去过那家、说不错的餐厅看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"저번에","meaning":"那次","explanation":"저번：那次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저번","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71227","senseId":"1","lemma":"저번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저번에","audio":"/audio/e5add28f76ad4e4a4fb2.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮다던","meaning":"不错","explanation":"괜찮다：不错；다던：引用以前听到的陈述，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"1","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮다던","audio":"/audio/2ca8b3930f75b395f095.mp3"}},{"text":"음식점에","meaning":"餐厅，饭店","explanation":"음식점：餐厅，饭店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"음식점","audio":"/audio/8d923a58de0234811588.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24055","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식점에","audio":"/audio/7dc46c78dd7eaca52965.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lem